0..79 Comment "//! `long-attribute-blocks` decorates declarations with outer and inner blocks."
80..83 Comment "//!"
84..163 Comment "//! An unknown `note` refuses every declaration it decorates. An inner `checks`"
164..215 Comment "//! block decorates its enclosing module or theory."
216..219 Comment "//!"
220..299 Comment "//! The checker reads each outer block as a whole. It assigns an inner block to"
300..330 Comment "//! its module or theory body."
331..334 Comment "//!"
